Upstream attribution and licensing
=================================

Adapted Hunter code retains its original Apache 2.0 notice; the complete license
is LICENSES/Hunter-Apache-2.0.txt.

Adapted preimage-chain code is attributed in README.md and Terminal.lean; its
upstream CC BY 4.0 license is LICENSES/PreimageChain-CC-BY-4.0.txt.

The upstream repositories and exact source revisions are identified in README.md.
Those notices and license files must be retained with the corresponding adapted
material. No license change to upstream material is asserted by this project.
